%%begintext align
A t\"un frae da days o' Faroe snacks.  Some say it wis a t\"un aboot
da smuggling a tobacca an speerits it guid on in yun days.

Dis is a fine een ta practise da wan doon an tree up as he starts
aff wi dat.
%%endtext

